# Coins of Magic (Q336), a first grade member: a level 40 character with the first grade
# membership, twenty silver dryads and twenty silver undines. Pano trades ten of each for a Beleth
# silver dragon at the fixed rate, then takes nine of each for the four-try game (coins rolled
# 2 2 2): two coins right on the first guess, all three on the second; a second game finds too few
# coins for the stake. Collob clears the trade, Ralford answers a first grade member and Bernard
# hears of the guild. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q336_coins_of_magic_first_grade.golden
character Collector 40
quest Q336_CoinsOfMagic <cond>=11 <state>=STARTED state=3
hold 3813 1
hold 3492 20
hold 3495 20
